    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_multi_tier_replication_manager" kindref="compound">MultiTierReplicationManager</ref> (v1.8.0)</para>
<para>Manages hierarchical replication with three durability/consistency tiers.</para>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">MultiTierConfig<sp/>cfg;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.auto_tiering_enabled<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">true</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_multi_tier_replication_manager_1af503eba79d95bf3a7e195df27e06e8a4" kindref="member">MultiTierReplicationManager</ref><sp/>mgr(cfg);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">mgr.assignTier(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;financial_transactions&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/><ref refid="namespacethemisdb_1_1replication_1a1ce83409e54fd9d02a229f8868405a87a27d3e561fdae26c0039edeb79f93fd90" kindref="member">ReplicationTier::TIER_1_CRITICAL</ref>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">mgr.assignTier(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;user_profiles&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="namespacethemisdb_1_1replication_1a1ce83409e54fd9d02a229f8868405a87aeef767dda7ea588f055c8a1e2b8556bc" kindref="member">ReplicationTier::TIER_2_STANDARD</ref>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">mgr.assignTier(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;audit_logs&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="namespacethemisdb_1_1replication_1a1ce83409e54fd9d02a229f8868405a87a58f29658223afe57eb6e7db22d54d400" kindref="member">ReplicationTier::TIER_3_ARCHIVAL</ref>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Record<sp/>accesses<sp/>for<sp/>auto-tiering</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">mgr.recordAccess(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;audit_logs&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Evaluate<sp/>and<sp/>apply<sp/>tier<sp/>changes</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">mgr.evaluateTierPromotion(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;audit_logs&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Thread safety: all public methods are thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
